#
# Platform lifecycle gate (system_ext): vendor init cannot trigger on
# persistent-properties readiness, so the one-shot start lives here (as for
# imsdcmd). This fires before the modem is necessarily up; imeiprovd itself
# waits, with a bounded timeout, for the TCL QMI service to appear on QRTR.
on property:ro.persistent_properties.ready=true
    start vendor.imeiprovd
